523:     "If you want to follow any list, not before several consecutive prospective weeks, knowing that today none beats chance.",
524:     "This page is already published at brayannbegu11.github.io/stock from the gh-pages branch; to refresh it after each run: python scripts/export_site_data.py then python scripts/deploy_pages.py."
525:   ],
